The '''Crypts''' are a [[Location]] within the [[Hub Island]], accessible through the {{Zone|Graveyard}} or a [[weak wall]] in the {{Zone|Coal Mine}}. It contains {{MobSprite|Crypt Ghoul;Crypt Ghouls}} and {{MobSprite|Golden Ghoul;Golden Ghouls}} and primarily serves as a place to complete [[Zombie Slayer]].

{{ZoneText|Explore the Crypts.|Watch out for the Zombies that lurk here!}}

== Mobs ==
While {{MobSprite|Crypt Ghoul;Crypt Ghouls}} spawn throughout the Crypts, {{MobSprite|Golden Ghoul;Golden Ghouls}} only spawn in the two larger rooms.
